\textbf{關於本卷 / About This Volume}\\
本卷為合參綜合本，非逐字合併三本獨立研讀（提摩太前書、提摩太後書、提多書各有其獨立成書，見同系列另三冊）。\\
This is a thematic synthesis volume, not a page-for-page merge of the three standalone studies (1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, and Titus each have their own separate volume in this series).\\[0.8em]

\textbf{聖經版本 / Bible Versions}\\
各書所標版本並不完全一致（詳見附錄「參考資料」誠實說明）：中文以和合本 (CUV) 為主，部分章節標示和合本修訂版 (RCUV)；English: English Standard Version (ESV)\\[0.8em]

\textbf{主要參考資料 / Primary Sources}\\
\textbullet\ 黃長老 Thursday 查經筆記 (2024-2025)——「盡職四大點」「三提合一」「清潔的良心」等真實查經框架\\
\textbullet\ John MacArthur - MacArthur New Testament Commentary\\
\textbullet\ G. Campbell Morgan\\[0.8em]

\textbf{核心主題 / Central Theme}\\
神的國放在第一位；三提串成一體：問題、盡忠、執行；盡職事奉的四大點，貫穿三卷書信。\\
Put God's Kingdom first; the three letters as one movement: the problem, faithfulness, and execution; the four points of fulfilling ministry running through all three books.\\[0.8em]

本書為三書精讀項目成果之一。\\
Part of the Three Books Deep Reading Project.
$endif$

