本書是三提（提摩太前書、提摩太後書、提多書）合參綜合本，以一篇新寫的〈三提合參〉領受總綱開卷，貫串黃長老 Thursday 查經筆記中真實反覆重述的「盡職四大點」服事框架（恩賜挑旺起來、善道靠聖靈守住、恩典上剛強、無愧的工人按正意分解真道），以及他所說「神的國放在第一位」「長老制會：問題、盡忠、執行」「清潔的良心」貫穿三書的教導線索，並收錄三書共十三章全文與合併參考資料附錄。這不是三本書的機械合訂，而是照著黃長老自己看待這三卷書信的方式——他稱之為「三提」——把它們當作一份完整的牧養教材來領受：一位屬靈父親如何訓練提摩太、差派提多，並在生命的盡頭，把「盡職」的呼召交託下去。

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}T}{his} is a synthesis volume combining 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, and Titus — opening with a newly written essay tracing Elder Wong's real, recurring "Four Points of Fulfilling Ministry" framework across all three letters, along with his teaching that these three letters together put "God's Kingdom first," establish elder-rule church government through "the problem, faithfulness, and execution," and share one continuous "clean conscience" thread — followed by the complete text of all thirteen chapters and a merged references appendix. This is not a mechanical merge of three books but a synthesis built the way Elder Wong himself treats these letters — as one unit he calls "the three pastorals" ({\normalfont 三提}) — a single training curriculum for ministry: how a spiritual father trains Timothy, commissions Titus, and at the end of his life hands off the charge to fulfil one's ministry.}
$endif$
\end{minipage}

